# Local credentials and environment configuration. Templates stay versioned,
# but real values must never be committed.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.template

.agents/skills
skills-lock.json
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Trained model artifacts.
#
# Most artifacts stay local (experiments, alternate model types, alternate
# horizons), BUT the xgboost 6h models are a DEPLOYMENT DEPENDENCY: the
# scheduled ingestion workflow runs model/predict.py, which loads
# model/artifacts/{city}_xgb_6h.pkl. If those files aren't in the repo, CI
# checks out nothing usable, predict.py logs "artifact not found" for every
# city, and 0 forecasts get written -- the dashboard silently goes stale
# while the workflow still reports success.
#
# So: ignore every .pkl EXCEPT the xgb 6h set that production actually needs.
model/artifacts/*.pkl
!model/artifacts/*_xgb_6h.pkl
ingestion/__pycache__/db.cpython-314.pyc
ingestion/__pycache__/db.cpython-314.pyc
